---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms of use" description="Terms for using Nepali Property Market and listing a business.">
	<div class="wrap narrow">
		<div class="page-head"><h1>Terms of use</h1><p class="muted">Draft: have this reviewed by a lawyer before launch.</p></div>
		<div class="prose">
			<h2>Directory only</h2>
			<p>Nepali Property Market is an introduction directory. We do not provide real estate, credit, legal, accounting or tax services and we are not responsible for services provided by listed businesses. Verify credentials yourself.</p>
			<h2>Sponsored placements</h2>
			<p>Businesses may pay for a featured position. Sponsored placements are labelled and do not imply endorsement.</p>
			<h2>Badges</h2>
			<p>“Nepali-speaking” indicates the business told us, or shows on its own materials, that it can assist in Nepali. “Licence checked” means we sighted the licence on the official register on a given date. Neither is a guarantee of quality.</p>
			<h2>Businesses</h2>
			<p>If you list a business you confirm you are authorised to do so and that your information is accurate and your licences are current. We may suspend or remove listings, including for misleading claims, licence issues or complaints.</p>
			<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
			<p>Do not submit false enquiries, scrape the site or misuse contact details for unsolicited marketing.</p>
			<h2>Liability</h2>
			<p>To the extent permitted by law, we exclude liability for loss arising from use of this site or dealings with listed businesses. Nothing here limits rights you have under Australian Consumer Law.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
